  "authorityDecision": {
    "id": "LA-STATUTORY-FORMS",
    "decision": "COMPOSE_FROM_AUTHORITY",
    "authorityHeld": true,
    "text": "The statutory forms prescribed by Louisiana C.Cr.P. arts. 987 through 995 and 998 are treated uniformly as COMPOSE_FROM_AUTHORITY. Generate them faithfully from the current codified article text. Existing PDF renderings of neighbouring articles are references, not a different product class. Do not wait for separate agency-issued fillable PDFs.",
    "scopeNote": "The decision names arts. 987-995 and 998 by number and states the principle that neighbouring-article PDF renderings are references rather than a different product class. Families keyed to arts. 976, 977, 978 and 985 are applied under that stated principle rather than under the numbered range; that reading is recorded here rather than assumed silently.",
